<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">17052026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>The World Health Organization has declared the Democratic Republic of Congo's Ebola outbreak a public health emergency of international concern... its highest alert level.</s> <s>Ninety people have died, and the agency says the current strain has a very high case fatality rate, with no vaccine or treatment available.</s> <s>The designation unlocks cross-border response funding — the mechanism that will decide whether this outbreak stays contained or spreads.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Israel killed Izz al-Din al-Haddad, commander-in-chief of the Qassam Brigades, in a Friday airstrike on Gaza City that also killed his wife and daughter.</s> <s>Hamas confirmed the death and called it the highest-ranking targeted killing since the Sharm el-Sheikh ceasefire began.</s> <s>Hamas is calling it a flagrant violation of the truce; Israel has not yet responded.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Lebanon's Health Ministry says Israeli strikes have killed two thousand nine hundred and sixty-nine people and wounded more than nine thousand since escalation began.</s> <s>Saturday alone, eighteen Lebanese were killed and one hundred and twenty-four wounded in Nabatieh, despite the November twenty-twenty-four ceasefire framework that was supposed to halt these attacks.</s> <s>The continuation of the bombing, eighteen months after the truce, is itself the development.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ukrainian drones killed three civilians in private homes in Khimki, a Moscow suburb, overnight, with additional strikes on Mytishchi and Istra.</s> <s>Kyiv hasn't claimed the strikes; Russia's air defense reported intercepting more drones over the capital region.</s> <s>The pattern's shifted — strikes on the Moscow ring are no longer confined to industrial or energy targets.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India expanded its Supreme Court from thirty-four to thirty-eight judges by presidential ordinance, bypassing Parliament to address roughly ninety-five thousand pending cases.</s> <s>President Murmu's order uses Article one hundred and twenty-four, but lawyers warn that without procedural reform, more judges alone won't clear the backlog.</s> <s>Several sitting judges retire in twenty twenty-six, narrowing the window for the ordinance to have any measurable effect.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Bill Cassidy, one of seven Republican senators who voted to convict Trump after January sixth, came third in Louisiana's primary with twenty-four point six percent.</s> <s>Trump-backed candidates Letlow and Fleming advance to a June twenty-seventh runoff, making Cassidy the sixth of those seven to be forced from office.</s> <s>The Senate slate that crossed Trump in twenty twenty-one has now been almost fully purged through primaries.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pope Leo has accepted UNESCO's direct invitation for a September visit to Paris, choosing the agency's headquarters over the UN General Assembly in New York.</s> <s>The first US-born pope is making the first Vatican state visit to France in eighteen years, from September twenty-fifth to twenty-eighth.</s> <s>The stop signals Vatican re-engagement with multilateral institutions after Washington withdrew from UNESCO last year.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Vladimir Putin lands in Beijing on May nineteenth, hours after Donald Trump departed the Chinese capital.</s> <s>Xi and Putin plan a joint declaration and bilateral documents, the Kremlin said, choreographing the sequence so each leader gets a separate stage.</s> <s>Beijing's signaling it can host both Washington and Moscow within a single news cycle without conceding to either.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Nigerian appeals court upheld a two-year prison sentence for George Turnah, aide to the former head of the Niger Delta Development Commission, for concealing a directorship while under money-laundering investigation.</s> <s>The commission oversees roughly a billion dollars a year in oil-region development funds and has now seen three managing directors prosecuted since twenty twenty.</s> <s>It's a rare accountability precedent for custodians of extractive-sector revenue.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Pakistan opened six overland routes to Iran, with the Gwadar-Gabd corridor cutting border transit from sixteen hours to three.</s> <s>The corridor effectively gives Tehran an overland bypass of US sanctions on its maritime trade, with Islamabad calculating that its mediator role shields it from secondary penalties.</s> <s>Whether Washington accepts that calculation, in sha'Allah, will be tested in the months ahead.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Cambridge International confirmed that an AS-Level mathematics paper leaked across Pakistan before students sat the exam, with solved versions circulating on social media.</s> <s>The board postponed a follow-on paper and Islamabad ordered an inquiry, but Cambridge holds credentialing authority without local enforcement capacity.</s> <s>Pakistani families paying global-standard fees are absorbing the cost of a leak market the institution can't police from England.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India and the Netherlands signed a strategic partnership on semiconductors and clean energy, with bilateral trade reaching twenty-seven point eight billion dollars last year.</s> <s>Prime Minister Modi also secured the return of eleventh-century Chola copper plates from Dutch collections, a quieter act of decolonial repatriation.</s> <s>Modi heads next to Sweden as Delhi accelerates its European industrial diplomacy.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Trump and Xi's Beijing summit produced commitments for two hundred Boeing jets with GE engines and a new trade council to negotiate tariff cuts of equal scale on each side.</s> <s>The Peterson Institute puts US tariffs on Chinese goods at forty-seven point five percent, up twenty-six point eight points since January twenty twenty-five.</s> <s>The council must specify what equal scale actually means before any reductions take effect.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Workers across Latin America marched on May first against wage stagnation, with Venezuela's government calling a fifty-dollar bonus a wage raise.</s> <s>Caracas has frozen the official monthly salary since twenty twenty-two, while workers estimate a family food basket costs seven hundred dollars — nearly three times the new two-hundred-and-forty-dollar income.</s> <s>The gap between the official wage and the cost of survival is now the country's defining economic fact.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The Vera Rubin Observatory in Chile has captured its first interstellar objects, beginning a ten-year survey that images the full sky every few nights.</s> <s>The telescope targets roughly thirty-seven billion sources, including near-Earth asteroids and failed supernovae.</s> <s>The survey has now moved from promise to a working data pipeline that will underpin a decade of astronomy.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A biosimilar of the macular-degeneration drug Lucentis has entered trials in Saudi Arabia and Jordan, the first Middle East sites in the FORCE study.</s> <s>The original trial excluded the region entirely; the new drug, FYB-201, costs less than Lucentis and will be benchmarked against European outcomes.</s> <s>It's a small correction to a long pattern of clinical research that treats the region as a market but not a study population.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Nature Communications study found that seventy-one percent of coastal people live in subsiding zones, experiencing six millimetres of relative sea-level rise each year — twice the climate-driven rate.</s> <s>Sinking ground in river deltas across South and Southeast Asia means global projections systematically understate the risk for Jakarta, Dhaka, and the Mekong.</s> <s>The water rises faster when the land falls to meet it.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A Texas county banned all new datacenter construction outright, a sharper step than the tariff negotiations US municipalities once used.</s> <s>Parallel fights are surfacing in Utah and Virginia as AI infrastructure strains power grids and water supplies, with no federal siting framework in place.</s> <s>Local governments are no longer haggling over incentives — they're closing the door.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>ArXiv, the preprint server underpinning physics, mathematics, and machine-learning research, will now issue one-year submission bans for AI-generated slop papers.</s> <s>Banned authors must publish at a peer-reviewed venue before resubmitting, forcing the open-science infrastructure to act as a quality filter that journals failed to provide.</s> <s>The de facto backbone of scientific exchange is being conscripted into moderation work it was never designed for.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Mullvad's exit-IP pool narrows to two hundred and eighty-four identifiable combinations, with each WireGuard key occupying the same percentile slot across all servers.</s> <s>That creates a stable cross-site fingerprint regardless of which server a user picks, undermining the core privacy claim.</s> <s>Any virtual private network with a small advertised exit pool shares the same structural flaw.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>